Fablestar Expanse names and branding
------------------------------------

Fablestar Expanse names, lore, setting text, branding, logos and artwork are
proprietary wherever they appear in the repository, including where they are
quoted in FSL-licensed files (for example, historical notes under docs/dev/,
test fixtures, and legacy identifiers kept for compatibility such as the
FABLESTAR_ environment prefix). The FSL grant covers the code and text of those
files, not the Fablestar Expanse material they mention.


Third-party components
----------------------

Third-party components keep their own licenses (for example, elkjs under
EPL-2.0 in engine/clients/admin-ui/ and engine/tools/worldforge/).
scripts/license_report.py lists every dependency's license.
